  "_comment_worlds": "Ids 220-399 are the four new worlds of docs/plan-20-levels.md, one block of twenty per world. 200-219 is reserved for the new movement verbs and is not declared here. Every id below is painted at that exact atlas cell by tools/art/tiles.py, which places them by index rather than by append order so the blocks can be filled in independently. Gaps inside a block are deliberate room to grow.",
