  "_comment_deeps": "World 4, TERMITE DEEPS. Chitin and packed earth; 260/261 autotile against each other and 262 is the background comb. 270 is the luminous breakable wall the Brood Queen fight is about.",
  "_comment_nest": "World 5, THE OBSIDIAN NEST. Volcanic glass and ember; 280/281 autotile against each other and 282 is the background glass.",
